{"seq":3,"slug":"mixture-of-experts","title":"混合专家模型：稀疏激活突破参数天花板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/pretraining/mixture-of-experts","wordCount":1166,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"混合专家模型-稀疏激活突破参数天花板\">混合专家模型：稀疏激活突破参数天花板</h1><p>混合专家（Mixture of Experts, MoE）是 2024-2026 年大模型架构的核心创新之一。它允许模型拥有数千亿总参数，但每次推理只激活其中一小部分（通常 10-20%），从而在不成比例增加计算成本的前提下大幅提升模型容量。MiniMax M3（428B/22B 激活）、DeepSeek V3/V4、Qwen 3.5、Mixtral 等顶级模型均采用 MoE 架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MoE 的核心思想是将 Transformer 的 FFN 层替换为多个&quot;专家&quot;子网络，由一个门控网络（Router）动态选择对每个 token 激活哪些专家：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>E</mi></munderover><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Expert</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = \\sum_{i=1}^{E} G(x)_i \\cdot \\text{Expert}_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Expert</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是门控函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是专家总数，通常只有 Top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个专家被激活（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\ll E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    TOKEN[输入 Token] --&gt; ROUTER[门控路由器 Router]&#10;    ROUTER --&gt;|Top-k 选择| E1[专家 1]&#10;    ROUTER --&gt;|Top-k 选择| E2[专家 2]&#10;    ROUTER -.-&gt;|未选中| E3[专家 3 ...]&#10;    ROUTER -.-&gt;|未选中| EN[专家 N]&#10;    E1 --&gt; COMBINE[加权聚合]&#10;    E2 --&gt; COMBINE&#10;    COMBINE --&gt; OUT[输出]\">graph TD\n    TOKEN[输入 Token] --&gt; ROUTER[门控路由器 Router]\n    ROUTER --&gt;|Top-k 选择| E1[专家 1]\n    ROUTER --&gt;|Top-k 选择| E2[专家 2]\n    ROUTER -.-&gt;|未选中| E3[专家 3 ...]\n    ROUTER -.-&gt;|未选中| EN[专家 N]\n    E1 --&gt; COMBINE[加权聚合]\n    E2 --&gt; COMBINE\n    COMBINE --&gt; OUT[输出]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>稠密模型</th>\n<th>MoE 模型</th>\n<th>比值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总参数量</td>\n<td>70B</td>\n<td>428B (MiniMax M3)</td>\n<td>6.1x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激活参数量</td>\n<td>70B</td>\n<td>22B</td>\n<td>0.3x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每 token 计算量</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>~0.3x 基准</td>\n<td>3.3x 效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专家数量</td>\n<td>1（整个 FFN）</td>\n<td>128</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每 token 激活专家数</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>~6x 基准</td>\n<td>需要更多 GPU</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"门控机制设计\">门控机制设计</h2><p>门控网络的质量直接决定 MoE 模型的性能。核心挑战是负载均衡——如果某些专家被过度使用而其他专家闲置，则参数容量被浪费。</p>\n<p><strong>标准 Top-k 门控</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>TopK</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>noise</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(x) = \\text{TopK}(\\text{softmax}(W_g x + \\text{noise}), k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TopK</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">noise</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>添加噪声促进探索，防止路由坍缩到少数专家。</p>\n<p><strong>DeepSeek V3 的辅助损失-free 负载均衡</strong>：</p>\n<p>DeepSeek 创新性地在不使用传统辅助损失（Auxiliary Loss）的情况下实现负载均衡。其方法是在路由分数中加入一个动态偏置项，根据专家的历史负载自适应调整：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>G</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>load</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G&#x27;(x)_i = G(x)_i + b_i, \\quad b_i \\propto -\\text{load}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">load</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>负载过高的专家被降低分数，负载过低的被提升，实现自动均衡而不干扰梯度流。</p>\n<p><strong>共享专家 + 路由专家</strong>：</p>\n<p>DeepSeek MoE 设计中，部分专家被标记为&quot;共享专家&quot;（Shared Expert），对所有 token 始终激活。这确保了模型有一个稳定的基础能力层，路由专家负责特化知识。形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>SharedExpert</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>TopK</mtext></mrow></munder><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>RoutedExpert</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = \\text{SharedExpert}(x) + \\sum_{i \\in \\text{TopK}} G(x)_i \\cdot \\text{RoutedExpert}_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SharedExpert</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TopK</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RoutedExpert</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"2026-年三大团队的架构趋同\">2026 年三大团队的架构趋同</h2><p>2026 年 3 月，NVIDIA（Nemotron 3 Nano）、阿里（Qwen 3.5 Small）和 Mamba 研究团队几乎同时得出相同的架构结论：</p>\n<p><strong>75% 线性层 + 25% 注意力层 + MoE 路由</strong></p>\n<p>这一混合架构（Hybrid Mamba-Transformer MoE）结合了三方面优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>线性层（Mamba/DeltaNet）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度处理长序列，固定状态大小</li>\n<li><strong>注意力层</strong>：精确检索和上下文学习能力</li>\n<li><strong>MoE 路由</strong>：稀疏激活扩大模型容量</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>线性:注意力比</th>\n<th>MoE 配置</th>\n<th>KV Cache 节省</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Nemotron 3 Nano</td>\n<td>3:1</td>\n<td>64 experts, top-4</td>\n<td>88%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qwen 3.5 Small</td>\n<td>3:1</td>\n<td>128 experts, top-4</td>\n<td>85%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mamba-3 (理论框架)</td>\n<td>4:1</td>\n<td>配置化</td>\n<td>~90%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种趋同表明，单纯的 Transformer（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）和单纯的 SSM（精确检索弱）都不是最优解——混合架构才能在效率和质量之间取得最佳平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"moe-的工程挑战\">MoE 的工程挑战</h2><p>MoE 并非免费午餐，它引入了独特的工程复杂度：</p>\n<p><strong>通信开销</strong>：Expert Parallelism 需要 All-to-All 通信——每个 GPU 持有部分专家，token 必须路由到持有对应专家的 GPU 上。这成为分布式训练和推理的瓶颈。</p>\n<p><strong>内存放大</strong>：虽然计算量只有激活参数量级，但所有专家参数都要加载到显存。428B 的 MiniMax M3 即使只激活 22B，仍需 ~800GB 显存存储全部参数。</p>\n<p><strong>训练不稳定</strong>：路由决策的离散性（Top-k 选择）引入梯度估计噪声。Expert 坍缩（所有 token 涌向少数专家）和路由振荡是常见的训练失败模式。</p>\n<p><strong>Token 丢弃</strong>：设定专家容量上限（capacity factor）后，超出容量的 token 会被丢弃或降级处理，造成信息损失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MoE 通过稀疏激活将&quot;总参数量&quot;与&quot;每 token 计算量&quot;解耦</li>\n<li>门控设计（Top-k + 负载均衡）是 MoE 成败的关键</li>\n<li>2026 年 Hybrid Mamba-Transformer-MoE 成为新的收敛架构</li>\n<li>工程上的通信、内存、稳定性挑战决定了 MoE 不适合所有场景（端侧部署仍偏好稠密模型）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章前一篇 <a href=\"scaling-laws\">Scaling Laws</a>解释为何需要更大参数量以及 MoE 如何在固定计算预算下实现</li>\n<li>工程篇 <a href=\"../engineering/training-infrastructure\">训练基础设施</a>详述 Expert Parallelism 的通信拓扑与容错设计</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../graph-neural-networks/foundations/message-passing\">图神经网络中的消息传递</a>展示另一种&quot;选择性信息路由&quot;的设计模式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"混合专家模型：稀疏激活突破参数天花板","id":"混合专家模型-稀疏激活突破参数天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"门控机制设计","id":"门控机制设计"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年三大团队的架构趋同","id":"2026-年三大团队的架构趋同"},{"level":2,"text":"MoE 的工程挑战","id":"moe-的工程挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Scaling Laws：参数、数据与计算的幂律关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/pretraining/scaling-laws"},"next":{"title":"检索增强生成：让模型接入外部知识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/applications/retrieval-augmented-generation"}}